      "summary_sent_score": 0.4955390989780426
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The gravamen of the FIR is that the appellant got married to the daughter of the complainant on 14.11.2019 in a mass marriage convention and the parents of the appellant were not happy with the 1 Crl.No.___ of 2025 @ SLP (Crl.) No.16006/2025 18:01:13 IST",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 503,
      "end": 757,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "14.11.2019",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 599,
          "end": 609
        },
        {
          "text": "1 Crl.No.___ of 2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 697,
          "end": 717
        },
        {
          "text": "SLP (Crl.) No.16006/2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 720,
          "end": 744
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.38023507595062256
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Reason:\nwedding which was held at a mass marriage, hence they were constantly demanding dowry / additional dowry.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 758,
      "end": 871,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24037283658981323
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "This fact got aggravated after the birth of the second child and under the guise that lot of expenditure was required to be made for his upbringing, therefore, the demand for additional dowry was also raised.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 872,
      "end": 1080,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3150709867477417
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "On the fateful day, i.e., on 29.04.2024, the wife of the appellant is said to have hanged herself and the information of the same came to be furnished by the sister-in-law of the appellant as evidenced from the inquest panchnama.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1081,
      "end": 1310,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "29.04.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1110,
          "end": 1120
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3284451961517334
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The investigation having been completed, chargesheet came to be filed citing 22 witnesses.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1311,
      "end": 1401,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3693394362926483
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Though charge is framed by the jurisdictional Court, the trial is yet to commence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1402,
      "end": 1484,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.42708614468574524
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "As to the actual Pradeep vs State Of U.P on 5 December, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/60093657/\n1 complicity of the appellant is an issue which has to be thrashed out by the trial court after recording of the evidence of the witnesses and its evaluation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1485,
      "end": 1758,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pradeep vs State Of U.P",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
